      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市放眼望去，\n到處都是寶可夢呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E02653E773C671B53BBFF0C000A5230865590FD662F5BF653EF59225462FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我聽說密阿雷是與寶可夢共同生活的城市，\n所以選擇到這裡旅行。真是選對了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211807D8AAA5BC6963F96F7662F82075BF653EF59225171540C751F6D3B768457CE5E02FF0C000A62404EE5907864C75230901988E165C5884C3002771F662F90785C0D4E86FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是呀，說到人與寶可夢的關係，\n我覺得我們也不輸給這裡呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F5440FF0C8AAA52304EBA82075BF653EF5922768495DC4FC2FF0C000A621189BA5F97621150114E5F4E0D8F387D66901988E15462300200100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢一開始是\n皮寶寶和捲捲耳……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF59224E00958B59CB662F000A76AE5BF65BF6548C6372637280332026202600100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但牠們在和我長～時間一起旅行的途中，\n進化成皮皮和長耳兔了呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46726050115728548C62119577FF5E664295934E008D7765C5884C768490144E2DFF0C000A90325316621076AE76AE548C9577803351544E865462FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是沒有和牠們變得很要好，\n這兩個孩子是不會進化的喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F6C926709548C726050118B8A5F975F888981597DFF0C000A90195169500B5B695B50662F4E0D67039032531676845594FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要不要用寶可夢對戰\n確認一下我們究竟有多要好？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B389814E0D898175285BF653EF59225C0D6230000A78BA8A8D4E004E0B621150117A767ADF6709591A8981597DFF1F00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果可以寶可夢對戰的話，\n就告訴我一聲喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C53EF4EE55BF653EF59225C0D623076848A71FF0C000A5C31544A8A3462114E0080725594FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我、皮皮，還有長耳兔，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和我們這支友好小隊對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211300176AE76AEFF0C90846709957780335154FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C621150119019652F53CB597D5C0F968A5C0D62305427FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欸～我心碎了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B38FF5E62115FC3788E4E86FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我們來場友好無比的對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3621150114F86583453CB597D71216BD476845C0D62305427FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉～輸掉了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509FF5E8F3863894E86FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是你們真是默契十足！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F4F605011771F662F9ED8595153418DB3FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和寶可夢相親相愛的程度\n一定是和我們不相上下！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C5BF653EF592276F889AA76F8611B76847A0B5EA6000A4E005B9A662F548C621150114E0D76F84E0A4E0BFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！先不說這些了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0151484E0D8AAA90194E9B4E86FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這兩個孩子輸掉了，\n現在一定是深受打擊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195169500B5B695B508F3863894E86FF0C000A73FE57284E005B9A662F6DF153D7625364CAFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我得像平常那樣\n到咖啡館放鬆休息一下！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F9750CF5E735E3890A36A23000A5230549655619928653E9B064F11606F4E004E0BFF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在咖啡館和寶可夢\n一起放鬆！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728549655619928548C5BF653EF5922000A4E008D77653E9B06FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這就是和寶可夢變得要好的訣竅！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195C31662F548C5BF653EF59228B8A5F978981597D76848A237AC5FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也要多多花時間\n和寶可夢們一起相處喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F8981591A591A82B166429593000A548C5BF653EF592250114E008D7776F886555594FF0100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在咖啡館放鬆，\n讓我們變得友好無比、所向無敵！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
